# Review

Answer each line with a pointer to evidence, or with "skipped" and the reason. A blank line means the review has not finished.

1. Class (throwaway, prototype, production, civic), and why this diff matches it.
2. Mode (learn, produce, play, or the other word you used), and why the reply matches it.
3. Pass sentence, written before the edit. Command and output.
4. Slop pass: code, interface, prose. Hits and rewrites, or the lines you checked.
5. Security row for that class. Scan output shows file and rule. No secret value.
6. Rerun record: command, versions, lockfile, seed or input. Or why this class does not need one.
7. Succeeded / failed / skipped / unverified.

Reviewer notes, when the change is code someone else will maintain:

- The change belongs here.
- It does what was asked, including the edge someone will hit.
- Nothing is more general than today's task.
- A test fails when the behavior breaks.
- Names can be read. Comments say why.
- I read these files. I did not read these files.
- Nits are marked as nits.
- Every finding has a file and a line.
